        "text": "next kick round. [11:30:45 PM] Round #9: Happy is holding the AWP [11:33:21 PM] mousesports: MIHS gets revolver [11:33:24 PM] mousesports: MIHS gets double pistol [11:33:45 PM] mousesports: MIHS gets double pistol [11:33:50 PM] mousesports: MIHS gets triple pistol [11:34:28 PM] Round #10: Happy wins the second round of the game. He got near perfect odds. [11:34:34 PM] Round #11: Happy wins another round and does not get a handicap in the process. [11:35:29 PM] Round #12: Happy gets damage. Xiaokiz wins. [11:36:45 PM] Round #13: Xiaokiz gets green and Happy gets AA. [11:37:14 PM] Round #14: Xiaokiz wins. [11:37:20 PM] Round #15: Happy gets AA. [11:37:28 PM] Round #16: Happy has won the NA, both players win the second 3rd round. [11:38:29 PM] Round #17: MIHS wins this round, Happy gets shotgun [11:40:40 PM] Round #18: Happy manages to pull off a pistol hit 4 times, and still holds HMG. [11:41:07 PM] Round #19: There is one reset, because Happy runs back to well and wins AA. [11:45:45 PM] Round #20: It is a grand final, so there is no normal 4th round. [11:49:11 PM] Round #21: Happy rips off a semi AWP on Mirage hitting perfect chunk HP and takes first round. [11:49:28 PM] mousesports: MIHS gets pistols [11:49:39 PM] mousesports: MIHS gets double stack [11:49:47 PM] mousesports: MIHS gets double stack [11:49:48 PM] mousesports: mousesports wins pNL silver [11:52:12 PM] Round #22: Liquid has moved on to playoffs [11:57:09 PM] Round #23: End of the round That is DH Winter 2015.<|endoftext_R9VQqF0Ag7|>If you have never really paid much attention to coffee, mostly made from coffee beans, it actually holds a dark secret that does more good than harm in cancer prevention. Among other things, coffee is apparently effective at helping your immune system hunt down large numbers of cancer cells that have started leaking into your bloodstream. Lest you think that this might be due to a curious lab experiment, a little known fact, inactive chemicals in the diet, such as methyl desyroid acid, play an important role in the phenomenon. A well-known study recently showed that green juice contains 100 times more forms of the desyroid amino acid than coffee. So by adding caffeine to something like coffee we are encouraged to increase the amount of amino acids available in the body, effectively increasing our exposure to this powerful anti-aging medicine. Guest Post by Christina Radclowski “Coffee may hold a dark secret that does more good than harm in cancer prevention.” On the average average adult women consume a minimum of four cups of green coffee a day. This might not sound a big deal at first, but it does not necessarily mean that the impact on your health is any less. The current issue of the scientific journal Studies in Nutrition will see to it that you notice the full benefits of this magic blend of caffeine and caffeine. The research, carried out by scientists at the Universities of Melbourne, Newcastle, Bristol, and Sydney, as well as at the University of New South Wales, recently revealed that only green coffees contain substances called desyroid amino acids that boost the ability of immune systems to fight cancer. In their research the scientists found that the desyroid amino acid in caffeine is normally stored in plasma, but the lemon juice added to the beverage helps to significantly increase the anti-microbial response in the body. Not bad, right? Not really. Juice contains 25% caffeine by weight and according to the same research green juice contains around 100 times more forms of desyroid amino acids than even white sugar. That means not only does caffeine have life-giving bactericidal properties, but it also has metabolism, boosting cellular activity and repair. Although the discovery is not surprising, as just mentioned, previous studies have already shown an effect of the caffeine on proteins that are degraded in virtually every"
